qwma"><div class="framer-qzt986" data-framer-name="meet the" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p style="--font-selector:R0Y7QWJvcmV0by1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Aboreto&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:21px;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(251, 237, 226)" class="framer-text">meet the</p></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-111y3eh"><div class="framer-1wgh81x" data-framer-name="bride and groom" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p style="--font-selector:R0Y7QWJvcmV0by1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Aboreto&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:70px;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(251, 237, 226)" class="framer-text"> bride and groom</p></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-4tov0q hidden-faqwma"><div class="framer-1wgh81x" data-framer-name="bride and groom" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p style="--font-selector:R0Y7QWJvcmV0by1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Aboreto&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:45px;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(251, 237, 226)" class="framer-text"> bride and groom</p></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-111y3eh"><div class="framer-1nr7fzo-container"><!--$--><div class="framer-UHnLD framer-s06v3h framer-v-s06v3h" data-framer-name="Variant 1" style="height:100%;width:100%"><div class="framer-vzvg8k"><div class="framer-ijl5j3" data-framer-name="We are both so delighted that you are able to join us in celebrating what we hope will be one of the happiest days of our lives. The affection shown to us by so many people since our roka has been incredibly moving, and has touched us both deeply. We would like to take this opportunity to thank everyone most sincerely for their kindness. We are looking forward to see you at the wedding." data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:rgb(251, 237, 226);--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text" style="--font-selector:R0Y7WWFsZGV2aS1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Yaldevi&quot;, &quot;Yaldevi Placeholder&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:24px;--framer-font-weight:700;--framer-line-height:1.4em;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, rgb(251, 237, 226))">We are both so delighted that you are able to join us in celebrating what we hope will be one of the happiest days of our lives. The affection shown to us by so many people since our roka has been incredibly moving, and has touched us both deeply. We would like to take this opportunity to thank everyone most sincerely for their kindness.We are looking forward to see you at the wedding.</p></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-4tov0q hidden-faqwma"><div class="framer-1nr7fzo-container"><!--$--><div class="framer-UHnLD framer-s06v3h framer-v-s06v3h" data-framer-name="Variant 1" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-vzvg8k"><div class="framer-ijl5j3" data-framer-name="We are both so delighted that you are able to join us in celebrating what we hope will be one of the happiest days of our lives. The affection shown to us by so many people since our roka has been incredibly moving, and has touched us both deeply. We would like to take this opportunity to thank everyone most sincerely for their kindness. We are looking forward to see you at the wedding." data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:rgb(251, 237, 226);--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text" style="--font-selector:R0Y7WWFsZGV2aS1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Yaldevi&quot;, &quot;Yaldevi Placeholder&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:24px;--framer-font-weight:700;--framer-line-height:1.4em;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, rgb(251, 237, 226))">We are both so delighted that you are able to join us in celebrating what we hope will be one of the happiest days of our lives. The affection shown to us by so many people since our roka has been incredibly moving, and has touched us both deeply. We would like to take this opportunity to thank everyone most sincerely for their kindness.We are looking forward to see you at the wedding.</p></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-111y3eh"><div class="framer-rifffs-container"><!--$--><div class="framer-TbqMA framer-m9xna6 framer-v-m9xna6" data-framer-name="Desktop" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-1b8vhu9"><div class="framer-4rlk9i" data-framer-name="The frame"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="506" height="758" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 691.09px, (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 691.09px, (max-width: 809.98px) 389.87px" srcset="https://framerusercontent.com/images/54JwjUrKR8txnFhN4dFmme3FzoQ.png?width=506&amp;height=758 506w" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/54JwjUrKR8txnFhN4dFmme3FzoQ.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=506&amp;height=758" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div><div class="framer-1ozbtfd-container"><section style="display:flex;flex-direction:row;width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:100%;place-items:center;margin:0;padding:0px;list-style-type:none;text-indent:none;opacity:0.001;user-select:none"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;padding:inherit;position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:39px;user-select:none;perspective:1200px"><ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:row;width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:100%;place-items:center;margin:0;padding:0;list-style-type:none;text-indent:none;gap:0;cursor:auto;user-select:none;transform:none"><li style="display:contents