-111y3eh"><div class="framer-1dnsgee" data-framer-name="Section 3"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="1350" height="2048" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) min(100vw, 1500px), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) min(100vw, 1500px)" srcset="https://framerusercontent.com/images/munXckNtNDlAiOMLLgrVsV1o.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=1350&amp;height=2048 675w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/munXckNtNDlAiOMLLgrVsV1o.png?width=1350&amp;height=2048 1350w" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/munXckNtNDlAiOMLLgrVsV1o.png?width=1350&amp;height=2048" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div><div class="framer-ayrbel" data-framer-name="Breaker"><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-xecmds" data-framer-name="Vintage car" style="transform:translateX(-50%)"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="520" height="779" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1790px, (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 2025px, (max-width: 809.98px) 1060px" srcset="https://framerusercontent.com/images/O07fRruEj5em3moPWz2blxIGqRI.png?width=520&amp;height=779 520w" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/O07fRruEj5em3moPWz2blxIGqRI.png?width=520&amp;height=779" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:contain"></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-1j1sems" data-framer-name="Things to know section" id="things-to-know"><div class="framer-1iqfo5o" data-framer-name="Combined"><div class="framer-1x762ok" data-framer-name="Heading"><div class="framer-1adc76j" data-framer-name="Things to know" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p style="--font-selector:R0Y7QWJvcmV0by1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Aboreto&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:70px;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(105, 107, 54)" class="framer-text">Things to know</p></div><div class="framer-32wbfp" data-framer-name="We are both so delighted that you are able to join us in celebrating what we hope will be one of the happiest days of our lives. The affection shown to us by so many people since our roka has been incredibly moving, and has touched us both deeply. We would like to take this opportunity to thank everyone most sincerely for their kindness. We are looking forward to see you at the wedding." data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p style="--font-selector:R0Y7WWFsZGV2aS1yZWd1bGFy;--framer-font-family:&quot;Yaldevi&quot;, &quot;Yaldevi Placeholder&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:20px;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(105, 107, 54)" class="framer-text">To help you feel at ease and enjoy every moment of the celebrations, we’ve gathered a few thoughtful details we’d love for you to know before the big day.</p></div></div><div class="framer-1q28ybr" data-framer-name="Information"><div class="framer-1wq5nfy-container" data-framer-name="Hashtag" name="Hashtag"><!--$--><div name="Hashtag" class="framer-5gCIX framer-1ar8i4h framer-v-1ar8i4h" data-framer-name="Desktop" style="height:100%;width:100%"><div class="framer-1x8nr7w"><div class="framer-f4gc8b"><div class="framer-1jzdh0c" data-framer-name="ChatGPT Image Aug 20, 2025 at 02_43_47 PM 1"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="171" height="177" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/5y8vl5sZQRnq3EHTA5uUoYOFwI.png?width=171&amp;height=177" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:in